Eric and I can give you a quick review and then Hector will just tell you how we put it all together.
Eric和我可以快速做个回顾，然后Hector会告诉你我们是怎么把所有部分整合在一起的。

45
00:03:19,839 --> 00:03:20,139
Yeah.
对。

46
