00:03:23,839 --> 00:03:31,349
So, the front Yeah, the front is one of the more uh obviously dense and integrated modules that we have.
前部，嗯，前部是我们最明显、最密集和最集成的模块之一。

48
00:03:31,399 --> 00:03:32,430
This is the business unit.
这是业务单元。

49
00:03:32,480 --> 00:03:33,372
This is Yeah, exactly.
这就是，没错。

50
00:03:33,422 --> 00:03:38,100
This is basically where you know, 50%of the parts and the content really is at.
这基本上就是你知道的，50%的零部件和内容所在的位置。

51
00:03:38,150 --> 00:03:39,464
And we did that on purpose.
我们是故意这么做的。

52
00:03:39,514 --> 00:03:45,040
We wanted to have everything isolated to one area for efficiency of low voltage distribution.
我们希望将所有东西集中在一个区域，以实现低压配电的高效性。

53
00:03:45,090 --> 00:03:50,509
We put all of the end points, all the electronics, where the control systems are.
我们把所有终端点、所有电子设备，都放在控制系统的所在位置。

54
00:03:50,559 --> 00:03:51,904
And so, that's kind of what we've done here.
所以，我们在这里就是这么做的。

55
00:03:51,954 --> 00:03:56,579
And we've also revolutionized, which we'll talk about a little bit later, how we do thermal system management,
我们还彻底革新了——稍后我们会详细讲到——我们如何管理热系统，

56
00:03:56,629 --> 00:04:02,022
moving, you know, another step uh from our super manifold of previous products.
相比之前的产品，又向前迈进了一步。

57
00:04:02,072 --> 00:04:05,270
We've got a 48-V low-voltage battery.
我们配备了一个48伏低压电池。

58
